  "question": {
    "text": "Given below are two statements :\nStatement (I) : A spectral line will be observed for a $2 \\mathrm{p}_x \\rightarrow 2 \\mathrm{p}_y$ transition.\nStatement (II) : $2 P_x$ and $2 p_y$ are degenerate orbitals.\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "qKqtz",
      "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are true",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "TEhox",
      "text": "Statement I is false but Statement II is true",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "6rCmA",
      "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are false",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "jws8u",
      "text": "Statement I is true but Statement II is false",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$2 p_{\\mathrm{x}}$ and $2 \\mathrm{p}_{\\mathrm{y}}$ are degenerated orbitals hence having equal energy and therefore no spectral line will be observed for $2 p_x \\rightarrow 2 p_y$ transition.",
    "image": null
  },
